  "title": "CHAPTER 5: CULTURE, ART AND HERITAGE OF GOA",
  "order": 5,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "010u73v",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.1 Languages of Goa"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Goa's linguistic landscape is primarily centered around Konkani and Marathi.",
        "The state hosts notable UNESCO World Heritage Sites representing its rich historic architecture.",
        "Goa's culture features prominent Hindu temples alongside diverse religious traditions.",
        "Traditional music and dance forms play a central role in Goan performing arts.",
        "Goan cuisine and traditional festivals highlight the state's unique cultural heritage."
      ],
      "id": "1l4ltjp"
    },
